methods\ that\ are\ HTTP\ GET\ handlers\ of\ controllers\ should\ not\ return\ a\ bare\ collection,\ because\ collection\ endpoints\ return\ one\ keyset\ window\ {rows,\ nextCursor,\ hasMore}\:\ page\ with\ su.onno.query.KeysetWindow\ and\ return\ the\ Page\ or\ su.onno.service.KeysetWindow.envelope(page),\ never\ a\ bare\ List\ or\ a\ bespoke\ entries/items/before\ shape.\ A\ truly\ bounded\ selector\ (it\ enforces\ its\ own\ maximum)\ is\ the\ only\ exception\ \u2014\ freeze\ it\ explicitly=1f47f77f-e04d-4eec-bc72-404bccbec905
no\ classes\ that\ are\ meta-annotated\ with\ @Controller\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ are\ assignable\ to\ any\ of\ [su.onno.repository.CatalogRepository,\ su.onno.repository.DocumentRepository,\ su.onno.repository.RegisterRepository,\ su.onno.repository.InformationRegisterRepository]\ or\ are\ assignable\ to\ any\ of\ [su.onno.posting.PostingService,\ su.onno.posting.PostingEngine],\ because\ typed\ onno\ repositories\ and\ PostingService\ are\ unscoped\:\ they\ ignore\ @AccessControl,\ RecordAccessPolicy\ and\ postRoles/unpostRoles.\ Serve\ requests\ through\ the\ su.onno.service\ query/command\ services\ with\ the\ request's\ AccessSubject\ (or\ a\ Commands<E>\ bean);\ if\ custom\ code\ must\ use\ a\ repository,\ move\ it\ into\ a\ service\ that\ first\ calls\ RecordAccess.require(subject,\ Type.class,\ id,\ AccessMode.READ)=d2d25e05-2b82-42e1-93bb-06e79ccaa9a6
